    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this truly unique three-bedroom property to the open market.\n\nRecently constructed and finished to a very high standard throughout, the property offers modern, well-appointed accommodation while occupying an exceptional setting on Eighter Island, just off the coast of Burtonport in Donegal.\n\nOffering a rare opportunity to experience genuine island living, the property enjoys a wonderfully peaceful and private setting, surrounded by the spectacular coastal landscape for which this part of Donegal is renowned.\n\nDespite its secluded island location, the property benefits from an impressive 500 Mbps broadband connection, providing excellent connectivity and making remote working and everyday online use entirely practical.\n\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property`s defining features.\n\nSurrounded by the rugged natural beauty of the Donegal coastline and Atlantic Ocean, the property offers a remarkable sense of peace, privacy and seclusion.\nEighter Island itself boasts beautiful sandy beaches and sheltered stretches of coastline, offering the opportunity to enjoy peaceful walks, the shoreline and the natural surroundings virtually from your doorstep as there is frontage of the property directly onto the beach\n\nThe nearby village of Burtonport provides a range of everyday amenities and acts as an important gateway to the islands scattered along this stretch of coastline.\nAccommodation\nInternally, the property offers bright, modern and beautifully finished accommodation arranged over two floors.\nThe ground floor comprises a Living Room, Kitchen / Dining Room with stunning views of the bay, a large Bedroom with an open fireplace, Shower Room and Back Hallway.\nThe first floor comprises a Landing, two further Bedrooms and the upstairs Bathroom.\nProperties offering this combination of recent construction, high-quality finish, island seclusion, spectacular coastal surroundings and modern connectivity rarely come to the market.\nWhether considered as a permanent residence, holiday home or distinctive coastal retreat, this property represents an exciting opportunity to own a home in one of West Donegal`s most unique locations.\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the property, its surroundings and the truly unique setting that Eighter Island has to offer.\nViewing is by STRICT appointment with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: 1317\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room - 5.9m (19'4\") x 4.72m (15'6\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 7.27m (23'10\") x 2.31m (7'7\")\nLaminate Wood Floor, Part Tiled, Fully Fitted,\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.38m (17'8\") x 4.19m (13'9\")\nCarpet, Open Fireplace\n\nShower Room - 2.61m (8'7\") x 1.87m (6'2\")\nTiled Floor, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBack Hallway - 5.83m (19'2\") x 1.74m (5'9\")\nTiled\n\nLanding - 4.11m (13'6\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.85m (15'11\") x 3.57m (11'9\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.87m (16'0\") x 4.2m (13'9\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBathroom - 2.32m (7'7\") x 2.11m (6'11\")\nTiled Floor, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
